## Success Criteria

A user should be able to:

1. Create an account.
2. Log in securely.
3. Chat with Lumora AI.
4. Save journal entries.
5. Track moods.
6. Track goals and habits.
7. View personal progress.
8. Receive daily motivation.

The application should be production-ready and deployable from GitHub.
